 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nWestbrook Pharma Ltd                                  MASTER SERVICES\n14 King Street, BS1 5TR Bristol, United Kingdom      AGREEMENT\nVAT No: GB239118873\nReg No: GB-543941\n\nFROM                                                    BILL TO\nWestbrook Pharma Ltd                                   Albion Components Ltd\n14 King Street                                         221 Baker Street\nBS1 5TR Bristol                                        M1 2AB Manchester\nUnited Kingdom                                         United Kingdom\nVAT: GB239118873\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 20/02/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Westbrook Pharma Ltd, with its registered office at 14 King Street, Bristol (\"Party A\"), and Albion Components\nLtd, with its registered office at 221 Baker Street, Manchester (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Westbrook Pharma Ltd / Amelia Clarke\nParty B    Albion Components Ltd / Amelia Clarke\nDate       20/02/2026",
